From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: tangenx <me@tangenx.dev>
Date: Mon, 5 Oct 2026 06:53:22 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 036/128] feat: split tele settings into sections and add them
 to settings search

The single tele screen grows with every feature and the row titles are
unfindable from the main settings search. The screen now opens section
screens (interface, privacy, ids, your data) from the root, and
TeleSearch appends every section and toggle to the ProfileActivity
search array, so 'ghost', 'peer id' or 'screenshots' land on the right
tele screen with a tele > section breadcrumb.

Constraint: search guids stay in the 950+ range to avoid stock clashes
Rejected: one flat screen with anchors | the stock search jumps to rows by id, tele rows live on another fragment
Confidence: high
Scope-risk: moderate
